        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Last night, a pair of giant wooden puppets appeared in the street art community. Their magnificence shocked everyone who had the opportunity to see them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "These fine puppets were created by one of the local artists, and during yesterday's rehearsal, they waltzed and fluttered under the moonlight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "We can see from the video how they danced so elegantly under the artists' control. Almost as if they were alive!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "The neighborhood is known for violence, gangs, and homeless, contributing to a high crime rate. It's an area that most usually steer clear of. But despite the risks, the performance last night attracted lots of visitors.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, let's go to our reporter on the scene and see what the attendees have to say.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Yo, Boss, un helado, por favor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1002_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hawker"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1000_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Boss?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_bar_1",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Se\u00f1or, what were you doing when the two puppets showed up?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was jogging at the time. Suddenly, I saw a huge face between two buildings. I was so shocked, I fell to the ground.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "But then I mustered up my courage, walked over there and watched the whole performance...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "And when it was all over, my legs couldn't stop shaking. I wasn't scared this time, though. I was stunned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Okay. Thank you again for your time, se\u00f1or.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Haha, from the way he's walking, it looks like he was telling the truth. Now let us turn the camera over to some of the artists who live here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe we can ask them why they made this pair of giant puppets? What stories will they have for us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Se\u00f1ores, se\u00f1oras, please place your bets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Casino Dealer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_176"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Excuse me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Casino Dealer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g8_slums",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, look at the little girl who just walked by. She's one of the main players here. Se\u00f1orita, a moment, please?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmm...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hear you're the mastermind behind this performance. For you to take on such a major role at your age...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yeah yeah, get to the point. I'm busy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sure. What's with the two puppets?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you go through all that trouble to draw attention to this community?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Heh, a few years ago, two buildings in our neighborhood burned down in a fire. None of you turned your attention to us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A fire...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Quietly) Nobody remembers... I knew it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The puppet show is to commemorate that fire. It's to commemorate our friends who left us that day. That's why we arranged to open our festival on the same day as the fire.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa is also scheduled to have its widely anticipated opening ceremony that day. Is there any pressure from that at all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe a little before the rehearsal, but basically not at all now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_ltroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$darkness_03_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The performance on our opening day will be even more sensational. I don't think an art museum can hold a candle to our performance.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how they spruce up their gimmicks, their opening ceremony is only there to tell us one thing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "text": "That Reynell can do business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Voice on TV"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_fastener",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you turn off the TV, Mi\u0142osz? I was watching that.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should get some sleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't want to. I'm not tired at all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sleep.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mi\u0142osz... Why are you frowning like that? Why aren't you happy for me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go to sleep, Reynell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been more than a decade. The birthday present that should've been mine is finally back in my hands. I'm delighted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really? Look at what a mess you are now. Say what you want, I'm not convinced.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That music box was supposed to be mine... Before my birthday... she said she'd give me one.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "But that old bastard wasn't happy about it. How could she have made a piece with absolutely no economic value?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's a genius, a star. Her works are meant to be sold at exhibitions for high prices. It wasn't meant to sit on a boy's bedside table, never to be known by the masses.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's made it back to you. After so many years, it returned to its rightful owner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I love it. Even though it's been modified beyond recognition, I love it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about her, Mi\u0142osz? Will she like my gift?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything you've given her, she couldn't bear to let go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why aren't you saying anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I do want to sleep now, Mi\u0142osz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
