        "intro": "$path_intro",
        "key": "$path_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I saw you on TV. You shouldn't have showed off like that for the media.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pap\u00e1, you're the one who suggested we make the giant puppets. If you were going to worry about showing off, you should've thought of that sooner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "*sigh*, Tecno. I just got a letter from the government.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "The letter says that if the arts festival is a success, a group of Leithanian cultural exchange representatives will come to our puppet show.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean... we might get government support?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's more likely we'll end up at their beck and call.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Warlords, merchants, politicians. There are plenty of men with their eyes on this plot of land. We're getting too much attention in too short a period of time. It's too much pressure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe this just goes to show how useless I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1212_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't say that, Pap\u00e1. Before you got here, nobody cared if this place burned for a whole day and night. There wasn't even anyone here to report on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's because you've been here for us that we got to live peaceful lives the past couple years. All of us know the work you've been putting in for our sakes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everything you've done, you did so we could walk under the sun again, no?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're another step closer to our goal now. What are you worried about?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tecno"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me think about it some more... Tecno...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1214_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't let the rest of you walk under the sun without any protection.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Diaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
