    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Se\u00f1or Mi\u0142osz, have you and Se\u00f1or Reynell seen the street art community's puppet show?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You chose to hold Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa's opening ceremony on the same day as their arts festival. Certainly their successful rehearsal has taken away much of the attention that deservedly would have been yours.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you feel any pressure?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please make way, ma'am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Se\u00f1or Mi\u0142osz, please answer our questions!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sorry, but we are not planning on taking anything from the press today.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_524_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Se\u00f1or Mi\u0142osz, is your silence an indication of the pressure you're under?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reporter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's close enough, se\u00f1ora.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Security"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
