        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g5_galleries",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is Miss Ela here yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. She's waiting in the exhibition hall.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Security"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I need to talk to her. Make sure nobody disturbs us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_020"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Security"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "48_g5_galleries",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Ela, sorry to keep you waiting. You'll have to forgive me. The outside is packed with reporters.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mr. Mi\u0142osz, why did you call me back from the art community all of a sudden?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're getting along well with them, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I am.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The people there are vivacious.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "And even though some of them are sick, their urge to create is as strong as ever.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "People who call themselves artists are a dime a dozen, but I have to admit that the people there truly love art.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Reynell? What do you think of him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "He... He's an interesting man.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that all?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid I can't see any of that in him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You once told me that Mr. Szczepan's paintings made you uncomfortable. That's because you have never met him. The discomfort that his personal presence brings to others is a hundred times greater than that of his paintings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it wasn't for him. You would've seen those qualities in Reynell.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing is beneath Szczepan as Kazimierz's most famous artwork dealer, be it verbal attacks, threats of violence, or economic suppression.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "He will do whatever it takes to make the artists working with him follow his every command. Not even his wife, Reynell's mother, could escape this fate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's a pain no creator could bear. It must have been an agonizing marriage.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're right. She even destroyed her own work as a form of protest, but only a week later, the damaged portrait was sold at auction for an astronomical price on account of its so-called profound philosophical meaning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She should've left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "She couldn't. She couldn't leave her child to the arrogant bastard, especially a child that very much resembled herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Deep breath)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is there a reason you're trying to get me to sympathize with him now, of all times, Mr. Mi\u0142osz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're a sharp one, to the point that it's frustrating.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Galer\u00eda Krysztauowa's opening ceremony is set to be held on the anniversary of Reynell's mother's passing. The day has a special significance to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps you and your team can help him out a little. Just a short while will do. If you could work it so the two events are even just one day apart.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Mr. Mi\u0142osz, but I can't.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4123_ela_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you've seen the news, then you know what that day means to the community.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Ela... You should do what you can. This isn't a request. It's a reminder.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "It doesn't matter how emotional or stirring their puppet show is. It will be overshadowed on the day the Galer\u00eda opens.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
