        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$dooropenquite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're awake.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Were you outside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, I met with Miss Ela.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did she say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "She refused.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not surprised.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why did you ask me to call her back here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The puppet show would be in good hands if she were to run it... And then, perhaps there would come a day when it forms an iconic performance that represents this place, as they hope it will.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it won't be on that day.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I almost sympathize with them. They're spending so much time, effort, and energy on this...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "To tell the truth, if it wasn't for the scheduling conflict, I would even go see the performance myself. Compared to the junk that the art buyers are gobbling up downstairs...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm a lot more interested in their creation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been some years since you last said you liked a particular piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Let them be. It's just a shame...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how overwhelming a piece of art is in the beginning, it can't compare to a magnificent death.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The last explosives are in place. I will make the final adjustments tomorrow to ensure that everything goes as planned on the day of the ceremony.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thank you for everything you've done, Mi\u0142osz. For me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
