    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No thanks necessary. Did you know, Reynell? When you talked about destruction just now, your eyes were sparkling...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just like when you used to talk to me about creation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1211_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just similar, that's all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reynell"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1213_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But it's more than enough to me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mi\u0142osz"
    },
